{"url": "https://x.com/AdamLowisz/status/2093386801692201110", "id": "2093386801692201110", "text": "I was up last night till 5:00 a.m. playing around with Grok Bot and made some amazing templates to help me connect with my fans. I bought X Developer API credits, for $2 I was able to get my weekly top 100 fans list and a monthly top 500 fans list. Here are the templates.\n\nTop 100: https://x.ai/bot/HU7XArfGhUgLnzVcr7neB\n\nTop 500: https://x.ai/bot/XzEATGwJNRvgsCLlcD9ox\n\nNow I will always know who are my top fans so I can connect with them and involve them in my projects, group chats, and other things. I told Grok to update these lists regularly. Something like this would have taken me hours to do by hand and probably wouldn't be possible to do manually to begin with. I haven't coded in decades, so I had no way to really code this up myself. It wasn't worth it to hire someone to write the code to do this. Grok Bot did it for me in minutes, I just simply talked to it like I would a normal person. This is like having a superpower for pennies on the dollar.", "raw_text": {"text": "I was up last night till 5:00 a.m. playing around with Grok Bot and made some amazing templates to help me connect with my fans. I bought X Developer API credits, for $2 I was able to get my weekly top 100 fans list and a monthly top 500 fans list. Here are the templates.\n\nTop 100: https://t.co/NCusY8SAy7\n\nTop 500: https://t.co/MqOaDLJz7V\n\nNow I will always know who are my top fans so I can connect with them and involve them in my projects, group chats, and other things. I told Grok to update these lists regularly. Something like this would have taken me hours to do by hand and probably wouldn't be possible to do manually to begin with. I haven't coded in decades, so I had no way to really code this up myself. It wasn't worth it to hire someone to write the code to do this. Grok Bot did it for me in minutes, I just simply talked to it like I would a normal person. This is like having a superpower for pennies on the dollar.", "display_text_range": [0, 936], "facets": [{"type": "url", "indices": [283, 306], "original": "https://t.co/NCusY8SAy7", "replacement": "https://x.ai/bot/HU7XArfGhUgLnzVcr7neB", "display": "x.ai/bot/HU7XArfGhU\u2026"}, {"type": "url", "indices": [317, 340], "original": "https://t.co/MqOaDLJz7V", "replacement": "https://x.ai/bot/XzEATGwJNRvgsCLlcD9ox", "display": "x.ai/bot/XzEATGwJNR\u2026"}]}, "author": {"screen_name": "AdamLowisz", "url": "https://x.com/AdamLowisz", "id": "17050482", "followers": 55006, "following": 6888, "likes": 155511, "media_count": 32832, "name": "Adam Lowisz X Meetup \ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8\ud83c\uddf5\ud83c\uddf1\ud83c\uddea\ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddec\ud83c\udde7\ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\udde6", "description": "Organizing Adam's X Meetups and other events. Click follow! Visit http://AdamXEvent.com for the next event. Volunteer and help @ElonMusk make X a force for good", "raw_description": {"text": "Organizing Adam's X Meetups and other events. Click follow! Visit https://t.co/UMpXgz27hD for the next event. Volunteer and help @ElonMusk make X a force for good", "facets": [{"type": "url", "indices": [66, 89], "original": "https://t.co/UMpXgz27hD", "replacement": "http://AdamXEvent.com", "display": "AdamXEvent.com"}]}, "location": "", "banner_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/17050482/1760654193", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1978953232698290176/EdCIw3PO_200x200.jpg", "joined": "Wed Oct 29 20:11:30 +0000 2008", "protected": false, "website": {"url": "http://AdamXEvent.com", "display_url": "AdamXEvent.com"}, "verification": {"verified": true, "verified_at": null, "type": "individual"}, "avatar_color": null}, "replies": 7, "retweets": 3, "likes": 28, "bookmarks": 2, "quotes": 3, "created_at": "Fri Aug 28 17:14:41 +0000 2026", "created_timestamp": 1787937281, "views": 9658, "is_note_tweet": true, "community_note": null, "lang": "en", "replying_to": null, "replying_to_status": nul